.TH AVR\-RUN\-DIAGNOSE 1 "" "avr 0.3.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-run-diagnose \- Explain a failed or unexpectedly slow workflow run.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr run diagnose
[OPTIONS] RUN
.SH DESCRIPTION
Explain a failed or unexpectedly slow workflow run.
.PP
RUN accepts the same Avrea IDs, GitHub run IDs, and run URLs as `avr run view`. The report combines jobs and failed steps, bounded failed-job log tails, queue/execution timings, runner metrics, and a prior-success workflow baseline.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr run diagnose run-abc123
    avr run diagnose 123456789 --json
    avr run diagnose https://github.com/acme/widgets/actions/runs/123456789
.fi
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIRUN\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output the diagnostic report as JSON.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-run (1),
.BR avr-run-cancel (1),
.BR avr-run-list (1),
.BR avr-run-logs (1),
